Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.89,0:00:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:00:58.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:01:02.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:05.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:36.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A homicide disguised as an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to detectives, it is highly\Nprobable that he was run over in such a way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:42.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that there would be critical damage\Nto his cybernetic cerebral core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:48.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But the truck driver alleges that he was sleeping\Nat the wheel and doesn't remember anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just to be sure,\Nwe're scanning the driver's cyberbrain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:53.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but we believe the results will be negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:58.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So we've lost our lead to the identity of the\Nman who threatened the Department of Energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Only if this man acted alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:07.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The subject's cybernetic body is\Na Type 2902 by Toyoda Chemicals;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:10.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the cybernetic cerebral core\Nis a Type 2706-Kai by Derumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While these are older models,\Nthey're brand new domestic ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:17.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The exterior is also a commercially available\Nstandard model without any modifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:18.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The face alone is haute couture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:21.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, judging from the\Ndeterioration of its cells,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's most likely a holdover from the subject's\Nfirst transition to a cybernetic body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:27.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's an unusually piecemeal\Nassembly pattern for a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:31.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In addition, his methods were apparently shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:37.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is possible that even the information\Nabout a scandal at the DOE was a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:40.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And yet he died right before\Nhe was about to be arrested,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in a manner similar to an assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is this symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:49.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It appears to be the symbol representing the Shinjuku\Nward, which was located in the former capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The one that sank below sea\Nlevel in the previous World War?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:56.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes. For some reason, this cyberbrain's\Ncerebral core is coated with glass and lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:58.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The symbol appears to have\Nbeen incised back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are the man's possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:04.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Among them is contact information for a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:08.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It should provide a chance\Nto learn this man's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:16.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And this would be... a Marriage Ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:21.77,Sign - Copy,,500,5,500,,{\b1}Latent \N Heat \N Source{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:27.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's true that he contacted our\Noffice and asked for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.92,Sign,,0,400,710,,{\fs52}{\fr10\b1}Dobashi Fumiya Office{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.92,Sign,,0,250,650,,{\fs52}{\fr10\b1}Reporter{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:33.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was a pretty fishy tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:36.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A public phone in Tokyo was\Nused to place the call...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about the tip itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:43.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was about a scandal involving the DOE.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:47.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As if you guys have the time to\Ncheck out every hint of a scandal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:51.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, we rarely meet with informants in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he said he'd send in proof, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:56.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Smoking or non-smoking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:06.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's pitch black...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, it was probably photographic\Nevidence of some kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's been completely exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He probably thought digital\Nevidence wouldn't hold up in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There aren't many people who\Ncan handle film these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can I borrow this for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:24.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's fine with me,\Nbut there's really nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:33.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, it appears that the subject was in Tokyo,\Nat least up until a few days before he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:36.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He evidently mailed this exposed\Nfilm to the reporter from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:38.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Head straight to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:44.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While you're on your way, we'll figure out\Nwhich terminal was used for the phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:46.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:50.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The rest of the team is continuing\Nto guard the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll send one Tachikoma unit with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder how bad the radiation's going to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How many years do you think it's\Nbeen since the last World War?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:03.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Residual radiation hasn't been detected since the\Ngovernment disseminated the "Japanese Miracle."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:03.24,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: The Japanese Miracle is a swarm of micromachines capable of removing radiation from the environment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:04.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}New Tokyo.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}This is New Tokyo station.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}The train that just arrived is bound for Berutarube...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:30.83,Sign,,0,1100,200,,{\fs52}{\b1}New Tokyo{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.76,Sign,,0,800,265,,{\fs52}{\b1\i1}Koushuu\N Highway {\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.76,Main Dialogue,,250,0,150,,{\b1}Former Downtown District{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.73,0:06:09.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you're worried about residual\Nradiation, I suggest becoming a cyborg!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I just felt like it, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You don't feel well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:18.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can carry you in my pod!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:20.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think that'll just make me get motion sickness. \N Just shut up and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:22.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hmph! What's THAT supposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.23,0:06:28.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So he called from this pay phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:57.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have you seen this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:06:59.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:02.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's supposed to have switched to a new\Ncybernetic body around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:09.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the guys around here are trying to get by with\Nthe minimum possible cybernetic functionality, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:11.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let me have a look, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:15.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There have been a lot of missing people\Nlately, so I may know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.61,0:07:17.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:18.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, so you were talking about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:28.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But four or five days ago, on another damn\Nhot day like this, a guy all dressed up in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:30.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a black suit asked me about him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He had a pretty vicious look to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:38.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, a young lady was asking after the same\Nguy just a while ago in the gathering area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:41.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, what'd this pretty boy do, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:43.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:44.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:47.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you know someone named Kotan Kanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:54.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:20.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess it's not easy to make\Na find like that again...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where's Togusa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:28.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The string...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:33.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Uh-oh, I think it broke...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you don't want to get hurt, get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Y-You'll regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:06.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:20.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,About the man who contacted the reporter:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:27.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We were able to confirm that there was indeed a man named\NKotan Kanji in the Kantou Residential Refugee Sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:32.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see. Just to make sure, I showed the\Nwoman the deceased's photo and ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:35.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She says they're Kotan's without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:36.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who is the woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:38.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Asagi Ruriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:42.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She was apparently with an NGO\Nthat aided refugees two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and that's where she met Kotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:52.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They continued to keep in touch afterwards,\Nand had even promised to marry someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:55.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but all contact from Kotan ceased three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:10:00.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When a message from him suddenly\Narrived a week ago telling her goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:04.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,she left Akita prefecture and\Ncame here to look for Kotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:07.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right. Continue questioning that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:08.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you feel better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:37.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He died, didn't he? Kotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:43.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kotan sent this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:46.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He said he'd be able to leave\Nthe refugee district soon, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But when he tried to get his ID,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:54.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kotan's cybernetic body failed\Nthe physical examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:57.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It didn't meet the minimum\Nfunctionality requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:11:03.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When he found that out, he started to... avoid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:08.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He may have thought that I was trying\Nto hide the requirements from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.81,0:11:11.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were you unable to reach him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:13.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I contacted him several times...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:17.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I told him I'd help him get a new body...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:20.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He refused, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:25.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When he was found in Niihama,\Nhe had already switched to a domestic model body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you hear about that from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:31.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:33.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:47.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Actually, before he died, he was suspected\Nof blackmailing a government agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After hearing your story,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:54.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought Kotan might have been blackmailing\Nthe agency in order to get a new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:56.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he already had a new body, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:12:02.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did he attempt blackmail...\Nwhen he already had a new body?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:05.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kotan had a difficult life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:08.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he wouldn't resort to crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:15.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But his death may not have been an\Naccident; he may have been murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:19.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,During the three months\Nthat you two were estranged,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,something happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Will you help me ask around in\Nthe gathering area tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe it was about a month ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:44.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There was a rumour that someone was gathering up lots\Nof labourers whose bodies were completely cybernetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:47.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was some juicy deal where\Nyou could get a good body
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:50.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,for free if you were willing\Nto go within Inner Beltway 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:51.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For free?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:53.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:55.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's this about "Inner Beltway 7"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's a submerged area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:02.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But since I haven't actually heard\Nof anyone who got a new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it might've just been a rumour, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:09.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This man seems to have got a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, does anyone here know about that\Ndeal where you could get a new body?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:19.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This man here apparently did get a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:20.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't know him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:28.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:43.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm alive today thanks to Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:46.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:50.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He taught me a lot of things\Nwithin Inner Beltway 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.42,0:13:55.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't really know, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.32,0:13:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was just working,\Ndoing whatever I was told to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:00.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you remember who your employer was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.30,0:14:04.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think it was Kuromatsu\NElectrics or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:09.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was to excavate a facility\Nthat got buried during the War.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:10.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We needed to go deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:11.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We needed to go deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:11.81,Sign,,0,0,700,,{\b1}Kuromatsu Electrics, Inc.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so they told us to come after our\Nbodies became completely cybernetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:14.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so they told us to come after our\Nbodies became completely cybernetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:23.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd initially given up because the minimum requirement\Nwas to have a body that was 98% cybernetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:28.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But a back-alley doctor fudged the\Npercentage for me, and I was able to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did those bodies have this symbol?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, everyone's did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:40.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sensei was really glad that he got his new body...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.20,0:14:45.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,even though no one can be 100% sure that\Nthey've received a totally new body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:48.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,since you can't see your own\Ncybernetic cerebral core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:54.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In the end, about forty labourers were rounded up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and went deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There were others who were\Nfudging their percentage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:04.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, I teamed up with Sensei and began working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I remember correctly,\Nit was called "Nekkou," or something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.48,0:15:12.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We had anti-dust masks on, but even so\Nour nostrils would still get pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:16.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sensei said that it would be fine if\Nwe deactivated our sensory organs...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:20.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but I said that wasn't possible for me,\Nsince I didn't have a fully cybernetic body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:24.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, he got this really scary look on his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and said that I'd die unless\NI got out of there right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:32.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But... I wanted money badly, so I didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why he gave me this, and told me\Nto get the hell out if it turned black.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:44.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And then, four days after we started\Nworking, something big happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:48.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sirens suddenly sounded...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:51.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We were wondering what the hell was going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,when a bunch of guys who looked like\Nengineers were carried out on stretchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:01.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I finally realised how dangerous this job was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's when you ran?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:12.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before we knew it,\Nguys dressed all in black had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:16.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The two of us were able to make it out of there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:20.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but when I glanced back on my way out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:24.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the ones who were with us had got\Ntrapped behind a huge steel door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What did Kotan do after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:35.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He said something about having to make\Nwhat he saw back in the tunnels public...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:37.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and went away somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:46.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can you guide us to that Inner Beltway 7 area?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll never go back there, even if you pay me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It can just be for part of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:53.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to know what Kotan saw there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:12.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The GSDF is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:16.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When I ran out of there, that fence wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:25.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you go in here, you should be able to\Nreach the place where it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:28.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry, but this is as far as I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:30.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,100,500,,{\fs52}{\i1\b1}No Unauthorised Personnel Beyond this Point. \N \N Protective gear and film badge required at all times. Evacuate immediately if readings are elevated.\N\N \N \N Tokyo Nuclear{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:21.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:28.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Armour Suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:18:59.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:18:59.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:03.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you all right, Togusa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:49.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Tachikoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:50.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:12.33,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: This is the Tokyo Metropolitan City Hall{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:18.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}The arriving train is bound\Nfor New Fukuoka, Mirai 52.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:23.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kotan must've decided to work there so he could\Nbe with you, even though he knew it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.90,0:21:27.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since he happened to be knowledgeable enough\Nto figure out what the facility was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:29.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:34.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll come back for his body after going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:37.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let me know immediately if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:39.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.36,0:21:53.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kotan witnessed an accident in the hidden,\Ndeep subterranean nuclear power plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:53.16,Default,,0,0,800,,{\fs52}{\i1\b1}Headline: Niihama Newspaper\NKuromatsu Electrics' President Commits Suicide\NCollusion With Foreigners Suspected{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:55.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He used that to blackmail the DOE...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:22:00.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it could be that he tried\Nto make the scandal public.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:01.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:05.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Judging from what you've told me,\Nit seems a criticality accident occurred during an
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:08.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,operation and the facility was hastily buried,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the military does not seem aware of this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.86,0:22:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The real question is, under whose jurisdiction and for\Nwhat purpose was this pre-World War relic being excavated?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:19.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Those black-suited men...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.37,0:22:23.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think there is still more to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:26.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Write a report as soon as you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.27,0:22:27.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:39.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\b1}Headline: {\i1}Labourer accidentally dismantled.{\i\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:16.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:26.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:30.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:34.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:36.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:37.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:39.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:41.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:42.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:44.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:45.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:46.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.16,0:23:47.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:48.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Our time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:51.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:51.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:52.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:52.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.41,0:23:55.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:00.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.67,0:24:05.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.67,0:24:06.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:08.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.73,0:24:11.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.13,0:24:12.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.33,0:24:12.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.79,0:24:14.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.83,0:24:15.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.27,0:24:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.57,0:24:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:18.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:22.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside\Nto make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:28.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
